<title>NEW ZEALAND: Warehouse finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>Warehouse finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand retailer Warehouse Group Limited said on Thursday its finance director John Vickers had tendered his resignation to take effect from July 31.</p>
<p>&quot;The group will be retaining his services on a consultancy basis,&quot; the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>No details of a successor were intially available.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
